<title>ARGENTINA: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ARGENTINA 44-21.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ARGENTINA 44-21.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Argentina 44-21 (halftime 27-15) in the second and final rugby union test of their tour on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Rolando Martin, Nicolas Fernandez Miranda. Cons: Jose Luis Cilley. Pens : Cilley (2), Gonzalo Quesada.</p>
<p>South Africa - Tries: Japie Mulder, Mark Andrews, Ruben Kruger, Andre Venter, James Small, Hennie le Roux. Cons: Henry Honiball (4). Pens. Honiball (2).</p>
</text>
